        "id": "p0",
        "title": "Jump Cancels",
        "text": "Some attacks can cancel into a jump when they connect. That's how you chase a launched opponent or stay glued to them during pressure. Whether it works on hit, on block, or both depends on the move."
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "title": "Air Cancels",
        "text": "In the air, certain attacks can cancel into a double jump or air dash - as long as you still have that air option left. A whiffed attack normally can't cancel like this - the move has to actually touch the opponent first."
      }
    ],
